<header class="ref-head cty-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Country history · Seven seas (open ocean)</p><h1 class="research-title">History of the Maldives</h1><p class="ref-lede">5 recorded states lay in what is now the Maldives, from the Chola Empire (848 CE) to the Republic of Maldives. 2 outside powers ruled here.</p></header>
